From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: agrucza <a.grucza@gmx.net>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 11:13:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2733/2733] firmware: qcom: scm: allow QSEECOM on the ASUS
 ProArt PZ13

Add the ASUS ProArt PZ13 (HT5306QA, X1P42100) to the QSEECOM allow-list
so that the UEFI variable service (uefisecapp) becomes available: it is
needed for efivars and for the PMK8550 RTC, whose driver waits for it.

Signed-off-by: agrucza <a.grucza@gmx.net>
Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
index 7df4536..0c54df5 100644
--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
@@ -2304,6 +2304,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_scm_qseecom_allowlist[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{ .compatible = "acer,aspire-a14-11m" },
 	{ .compatible = "acer,aspire-a16-11m" },
 	{ .compatible = "anduril,bluechip" },
+	{ .compatible = "asus,proart-pz13-ht5306qa" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,vivobook-s15" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,vivobook-s15-x1p4" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,vivobook-s16-s3607qa" },
-- 
